dsh-workbuddy-connect (https://github.com/corrinehu/dsh-workbuddy-connect)
Licensed under the MIT License.

The WorkBuddy at-rest credential envelope format (AES-256-GCM with the
"WB-AAD" authenticated-context framing, the SHA-256 protector-key derivation,
and the key-id convention) and the upstream gateway protocol details
(endpoints, header sets, request bodies, catalog membership rules and the
billing document shape) were derived from that project's implementation and
from live traffic of the WorkBuddy desktop application. The Go implementation
in this repository is an independent port; no source code was copied verbatim.

