cpa-multi-plugins (https://github.com/mmqz/cpa-multi-plugins)
Copyright 2026 Sliverkiss / mmqz. Licensed under the MIT License.

The Qoder source (backend/qoder_cosy.go, backend/qoder_auth.go,
backend/source_qoder.go) and the Trae source (backend/trae_auth.go,
backend/source_trae.go) reproduce protocol details derived from that project:

  - Qoder: the device-authorization OAuth flow (client_id, selectAccounts /
    deviceToken poll+refresh endpoints, PKCE-S256 construction), the COSY
    request-signing algorithm (RSA-wrapped AES session key, AES-128-CBC identity
    seal, MD5 request signature and its exact header set), the QoderEncoding
    custom-base64 body encoding, the gateway chat/model endpoints, and the
    nested SSE envelope shape.
  - Trae: the CN realm constants (agent host, client id, app id, ide version /
    version code), the loopback `/authorize` OAuth callback flow, the
    ExchangeToken request/response shape, the ECDSA device-key requirement, the
    get_detail_param catalog shape, and the llm_utils_chat request body plus its
    event-stream (event:output / token_usage / done) to OpenAI-SSE translation.

The Go implementation in this repository is an independent port; no source code
was copied verbatim.

